roof.OnlineConvexFirstOrder\n+warning: BanditRLProof/OnlineConvexFirstOrder.lean:26:0: automatically included section variable(s) unused in theorem `BanditRL.OnlineConvex.finitePart_eventually`:\n+  [InnerProductSpace ℝ E]\n+  [CompleteSpace E]\n+consider restructuring your `variable` declarations so that the variables are not in scope or explicitly omit them:\n+  omit [InnerProductSpace ℝ E] [CompleteSpace E] in theorem ...\n+\n+Note: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.unusedSectionVars false`\n+⚠ [3294/3310] Replayed BanditRLProof.OnlineConvexOptimality\n+warning: BanditRLProof/OnlineConvexOptimality.lean:42:0: automatically included section variable(s) unused in theorem `BanditRL.OnlineConvex.minOn_finitePart_iff`:\n+  [NormedAddCommGroup E]\n+  [InnerProductSpace ℝ E]\n+  [CompleteSpace E]\n+consider restructuring your `variable` declarations so that the variables are not in scope or explicitly omit them:\n+  omit [NormedAddCommGroup E] [InnerProductSpace ℝ E] [CompleteSpace E] in theorem ...\n+\n+Note: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.unusedSectionVars false`\n+warning: BanditRLProof/OnlineConvexOptimality.lean:60:51: unused variable `hV`\n+\n+Note: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.unusedVariables false`\n+warning: BanditRLProof/OnlineConvexOptimality.lean:61:5: unused variable `hne`\n+\n+Note: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.unusedVariables false`\n+⚠ [3295/3310] Replayed BanditRLProof.OnlineClosedProper\n+warning: BanditRLProof/OnlineClosedProper.lean:79:0: automatically included section variable(s) unused in theorem `BanditRL.OnlineConvex.sourceProper_indicator_iff`:\n+  [TopologicalSpace E]\n+consider restructuring your `variable` declarations so that the variables are not in scope or explicitly omit them:\n+  omit [TopologicalSpace E] in theorem ...\n+\n+Note: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.unusedSectionVars false`\n+✔ [3310/3310] Built BanditRLProof.OnlinePresc