ks verified: all21old cards, prior lessons and unrelated objects preserved. One coherent source card and3real declaration highlights match frozen core mathematics, actual selected VALUE parents, atomic premises and conditional Option-run boundary. Generator status compiled is valid. Source optimality gap/fixed exercise and B4 remain explicit;7containers+6futureclaims/C2partial/null/GoalACTIVE unchanged. Test import is conditional on independent complete canary BODY acceptance. No application, gate, package, chapter or live acceptance."},{"sha":"81fb8f0c9ae93d2367332ef05439f4251a04d19d","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/fresh-production-body-review-v1.json","status":"added","additions":315,"deletions":0,"changes":315,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Ffresh-production-body-review-v1.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Ffresh-production-body-review-v1.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Ffresh-production-body-review-v1.json?ref=b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,315 @@\n+{\n+  \"verdict\": \"accepted-candidate-core-only\",\n+  \"blocking_repairs\": [],\n+  \"reviewer\": \"/root/adaptive_reviewer\",\n+  \"requested_model_effort\": \"GPT-6 Astra / medium; runtime not attested\",\n+  \"source_sha256\": \"9b755a12d540c1039b068e4b97af90ac483a58fd1a8b40af9c806264f95d42b8\",\n+  \"frozen_headers_sha256\": \"1d6cda54b46476323dccaeae6fc3b33e8d1494bb655b99045ea2cde569b8e20a\",\n+  \"corrected_manifest_sha256\": \"e2372c790fdad6856746381fec27a5acc688e63118503d5ba9a20a404e7901a2\",\n+  \"55_corrected_manifest_artifacts_verified\": true,\n+  \"review_order\": \"Source-only topology V2 review sealed c97719bbe8264c8d953b311d78355a1ee2d337381a5eb7c3ba1859cf26bb9fe0 before parent authorization and first candidate BODY read.\",\n+  \"public_theorems\": 3,\n+  \"extra_public_helpers\": 0,\n+  \"header_context_check\": \"Full context and three statements equal after BODY erasure and whitespace normalization; native individual exact statement fences also match.\",\n+  \"proof_findings\": {\n+    \"quadratic_geometry\": \"Actual HasGradientAt is proved from norm-square Frechet derivative and dual evaluation, not assumed arbitrary gradient. Expanding oriented Bregman divergence and norm difference gives exact half squared distance. Complete Hilbert generalization explicit.\",\n+    \"variable\": \"Derives quadratic strict convexity using StrongConvexOn, actual differentiability, continuous closed sublevels on univ and SourceProper from no-bottom/domain. Exact algebra rewrites supplied attained quadratic minima into shared Bregman objective. iterate_eq_of_source_updates proves SAME actual Option run; source_variable_regret gives full EReal new-state score, previous-state max, last used eta and negative movement squares.\",\n+    \"fixed\": \"Same actual-run identification and source_fixed_regret, with exact finite-sum scalar normalization. No positive-horizon premise, so T0 retained. No affine/Lipschitz loss restriction or assumed regret/conclusion.\",\n+    \"attainment\": \"hmin remains explicit feasible attained-update premise. No unconditional existence, global total selector or recovery after None. Finite feasible losses make toReal scoring faithful.\",\n+    \"source_gap\": \"Implementation uses accepted generic proximal/source endpoints and selector identification. It does not certify the literal author constrained-support existence step; SRC-OPTIMALITY remains unresolved source-proof justification. Fixed exercise remains a printed gap whose bound is supplied by reused accepted fixed endpoint, not omitted.\"\n+  },\n+  \"compiled_eviden