un plus regret including T0. Frozen statements/context unchanged; no extra public helper or premise. Actual compiled VALUEs include shared geometry, corresponding accepted source endpoints and selector-run identification. Public probe, exporter, focused-v3 and three individual fences pass; standard three axioms only. Two implementation failures and false-selfhash packaging failure remain preserved; corrected55-artifact manifest verifies. Author optimality-source gap remains unresolved and is not silently repaired by this implementation route. No canary/package/chapter/B4/Goal acceptance."},{"sha":"69e4203cfa1585a5c5d33b9672fb4fb19bb5b3b3","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/fresh-source-topology-review-v1.json","status":"added","additions":109,"deletions":0,"changes":109,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Ffresh-source-topology-review-v1.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Ffresh-source-topology-review-v1.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Ffresh-source-topology-review-v1.json?ref=b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,109 @@\n+{\n+  \"verdict\": \"repair-before-source-topology-acceptance\",\n+  \"blocking_repairs\": [\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"T1\",\n+      \"paths\": [\n+        \"/nodes[id=SRC-OPTIMALITY]\",\n+        \"/source_proof_edges[to=SRC-VARIATIONAL]\",\n+        \"/source_proof_edges[to=SRC-ONES]\"\n+      ],\n+      \"finding\": \"Literal source claims existence of one global loss subgradient satisfying the constrained variational inequality. The proposed boundary says applicability is not certified, but the operative node/edges lack an explicit unresolved validity status. Mere nonempty global supports and an attained constrained update do not, without a justified optimality/sum-rule route, certify that selected support. This review does not establish a counterexample or statement falsity.\",\n+      \"required_repair\": \"Preserve author claim and its source location; annotate an explicit unresolved source-proof-justification/SOURCE_GAP obligation on this claim and propagated literal route. Separate the alternative proximal/segment proof route; do not label it a silent repair or verification of the author existence-of-g step. Keep the same g joined between SRC-SUPPORT and SRC-VARIATIONAL, e.g. explicit SRC-OPTIMALITY-to-SRC-SUPPORT binding.\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"T2\",\n+      \"paths\": [\n+        \"/source_proof_edges[to=SPEC-VAR]\",\n+        \"/source_proof_edges[to=SPEC-FIX]\",\n+        \"/nodes[id=SPEC-VAR]\",\n+        \"/nodes[id=SPEC-FIX]\"\n+      ],\n+      \"finding\": \"Frozen specialized headers conclude actual Option-iterate equality AND regret inequality. Current AND parents quadratic geometry plus generic regret theorem cover the bound but do not explicitly cover equality of the canonical chosen trajectory to the arbitrary supplied attained-minimizer sequence.\",\n+      \"required_repair\": \"Add a labeled specialization/algorithm-interface obligation for quadratic objective equality, uniqueness/identification of feasible attained minimizers under the frozen support/strict-convexity setting, and finite induction identifying the actual Option run. Bind SRC-ALG15.8, H-ATTAINED, hinit and quadratic geometry; include this as mandatory AND dependency of both full specialized targets. Do not assert the obligation proved or inspect implementation to populate it. No unconditional minimizer existence/total selector claim.\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"reviewer\": \"/root/adaptive_reviewer\",\n+  \"requested_model_effort\": \"GPT-6 Astra / medium; runtime not attested\",\n+  \"reviewed_topology_sha256\": \"b2e51a9780ed1ae8504cdc85cdff832fc748cb0cab2d48c120e67b36979e0ea0\",\n+  \"scope\": \"Source-only topology versus exact frozen three headers/context; no candidate implementation, proof BODY or candidate snapshots read. No build/source mutation.\",\n+  \"original_source_pixels_personally_reviewed\": [\n+    26,\n+    277,\n+    278\n+  ],\n+  \"input_refs\": [\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"runs\\\\online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011\\\\source-topology-proposal-v1\\\\topology.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"b2e51a9780ed1ae8504cdc85cdff832fc748cb0cab2d48c120e67b36979e0ea0\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"runs\\\\online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011\\\\source-topology-proposal-v1\\\\topology.md\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"4379732e2f684a592ef9530a610c70271505abb58c8b716d43c6abbc5e252a4f\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"docs/contracts/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-v1/neutral-frozen-headers-v1.txt\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"1d6cda54b46476323dccaeae6fc3b33e8d1494bb655b99045ea2cde569b8e20a\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"docs/contracts/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-v1/neutral-frozen-imported-definitions-v1.txt\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"dff55f4b3262afa2869e8dce05cf27bde92b8ef94945f31c7a198a0c8f39c9a1\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"docs/contracts/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-v1/neutral-frozen-standard-definitions-v1.txt\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"a5bf043f78dca8dc95e501b13ee41c9bfef17638ba2ecd2145edb833c5a0e06e\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"docs/contracts/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-v1/leaf-freeze-receipt-v1.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"5700ff43e6e80e383d74475ae53b59389ed04cbcf63ed9723ad228ab93153712\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/source-readiness/source-scope-adjudication-v1.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"1056a4051c15e2e95b1d0b50302d14211661da078436e170e7162885c1d2a0de\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"E:\\\\ABRL\\\\worktrees\\\\research-online-ogd\\\\tmp\\\\pdfs\\\\or