tained; constant-step reconstruction described prospectively, not already inspected BODY.\"\n+  },\n+  \"accepted_semantic_deltas\": [\n+    \"Quadratic geometry on complete real Hilbert space is labeled a generalization; finite-dimensional consumers preserve source setting.\",\n+    \"X=univ discharges interior; initial point need not be feasible. hmin supplies actual feasible attained updates conditionally; Option failure remains meaningful.\",\n+    \"Loss no-bottom/effective-domain/global support retain finite feasible values; no silent real-only restriction.\",\n+    \"Previous-state max excludes terminal xT; last used eta is eta(T-1); half factors and negative movement squares retained; negative stability does not imply total regret nonpositive.\",\n+    \"Fixed T0 is a labeled extension; variable requires nonempty horizon. Both endpoint branches required AND; broader conceptual/proof route choices not implementation VALUE necessity.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"additional_precision\": \"Attach H-NONEMPTY-HORIZON directly or by explicit inheritance to SRC-TH15.30-VAR and SPEC-VAR; specialized nodes should inherit all frozen hypothesis IDs so isolated graph consumers cannot treat them as unconditional.\",\n+  \"proof_and_closure_status\": \"No BODY acceptance, prescient container closure, Chapter15/B4/Goal closure or denominator inferred.\",\n+  \"utc\": \"2026-10-11T06:49:27.903244+00:00\"\n+}"},{"sha":"55565097a4b0ecba1779e039a4b10b0c03643731","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/fresh-source-topology-review-v1.md","status":"added","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Ffresh-source-topology-review-v1.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Ffresh-source-topology-review-v1.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Ffresh-source-topology-review-v1.md?ref=b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+Source topology requires two bounded repairs before acceptance. Preserve SRC-OPTIMALITY as the author claim but explicitly mark its constrained global-support justification unresolved and bind the same support witness across the one-step route. Add the mandatory actual-Option-run identification obligation to both specialized conjunction endpoints; a regret theorem plus quadratic identity alone does not document that conjunct. No candidate BODY was read. Personally viewed source PDF26/277/278; all22 scoped nodes and5 exclusions otherwise cover the relevant printed mathematics, fixed exercise gap and negative stability boundary. No source weakening, total selector, Chapter15/B4 or Goal closure."},{"sha":"7c3d332b9b51d2152fb3f14de32d8d66feff8a3c","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/fresh-source-topology-review-v2.json","status":"added","additions":109,"deletions":0,"changes":109,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Ffresh-source-topology-review-v2.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Ffresh-source-topology-review-v2.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Ffresh-source-topology-review-v2.json?ref=b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,109 @@\n+{\n+  \"verdict\": \"accepted-with-explicit-delta\",\n+  \"blocking_repairs\": [],\n+  \"reviewer\": \"/root/adaptive_reviewer\",\n+  \"requested_model_effort\": \"GPT-6 Astra / medium;