zen headers.\",\n+    \"SPEC-ACTUAL-RUN is an obligation, not an inspected proof; supplied attained-update premise is conditional and does not make the Option selector globally total.\",\n+    \"Hilbert-space geometry extension and finite-dimensional consumers retained; previous-state max, last used eta, exact half factors and negative movements remain.\",\n+    \"Source topology and conceptual OR routes are not actual proof-value dependencies or necessity claims. BTRL/15.31/B4 remain separately owned and open.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"no_closure\": \"No prescient-container, Chapter15, B4 or Goal closure; no denominator inference.\",\n+  \"input_refs\": [\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"runs\\\\online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011\\\\source-topology-proposal-v2\\\\topology.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"f317dce023cae552746ad8ef38163e646d3b77712feffc73468ceac41efee448\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"runs\\\\online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011\\\\source-topology-proposal-v2\\\\topology.md\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"de5575f7db0ecc602c72e762257e310123af27cb85fecc181a10376ec01622d0\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"docs/contracts/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-v1/neutral-frozen-headers-v1.txt\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"1d6cda54b46476323dccaeae6fc3b33e8d1494bb655b99045ea2cde569b8e20a\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"docs/contracts/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-v1/neutral-frozen-imported-definitions-v1.txt\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"dff55f4b3262afa2869e8dce05cf27bde92b8ef94945f31c7a198a0c8f39c9a1\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"docs/contracts/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-v1/neutral-frozen-standard-definitions-v1.txt\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"a5bf043f78dca8dc95e501b13ee41c9bfef17638ba2ecd2145edb833c5a0e06e\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"docs/contracts/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-v1/leaf-freeze-receipt-v1.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"5700ff43e6e80e383d74475ae53b59389ed04cbcf63ed9723ad228ab93153712\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"runs/online-ch