_regret\",\n+    \"declaration:BanditRL.OnlinePrescientBregman.euclidean_fixed_regret\"\n+  ],\n+  \"lesson_group\": {\n+    \"one_source_card\": true,\n+    \"three_adjacent_existing_schema_highlights\": true,\n+    \"reason\": \"Current schema binds one highlight to one full_name; grouping is pedagogical, no synthetic canonical declaration or invented multi-name schema.\"\n+  },\n+  \"layers\": {\n+    \"source\": \"approved topologyV2 retains unresolved author optimality/global-support justification and mandatory fixed exercise\",\n+    \"Lean\": \"actual selected VALUE occurrences only; no imported-module=proof-edge or necessity claim\",\n+    \"compressed_spine\": \"one compact lesson group is a summary of three real declarations, not source coverage count or full source topology\",\n+    \"functor\": \"quadratic specialization is conceptual transport; no separate formal functor/setting transport theorem asserted; any conceptual arrows dashed overlays\"\n+  },\n+  \"pending\": [\n+    \"production BODY acceptance\",\n+    \"canary BODY acceptance\",\n+    \"shared root/Tests/full harness\",\n+    \"contributor/site/registry/visual/integration/FINAL acceptance\"\n+  ],\n+  \"unchanged\": [\n+    \"historical completion_definition\",\n+    \"old source cards and highlights\",\n+    \"all unrelated parsed objects\",\n+    \"coverage statuses and seven-plus-six open counts\",\n+    \"frozen source topology/headers\",\n+    \"results/roadmap/global milestones\",\n+    \"generated site and graph files\"\n+  ],\n+  \"acceptance_boundaries\": \"Locally compiled candidate; independent production BODY, complete canary BODY, combined project and final package acceptance pending. All seven Chapter2 forward containers and six future claims remain open; Chapter2 partial, accepted=false, proof denominator=null and Chapters1–16 GoalACTIVE. No source-container closure, main or live-publication claim.\",\n+  \"inputs_unchanged\": true\n+}"},{"sha":"9626293a6a1f02ddd21306df6a09b3